### Gateway traffic entry point — ALL requests go through :4004 now.
### Backend ports (4000/4001/4002) are internal-only behind this gateway.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4004

### ── Analytics Service ───────────────────────────────────────────

### Lifetime totals by event type
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/analytics/patients/total

### Totals filtered from a date
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/analytics/patients/total?since=2026-08-01

### Per-day counts, default window (last 30 days)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/analytics/patients/by-day

### Per-day counts, custom window
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/analytics/patients/by-day?from=2026-08-01&to=2026-08-10

### ── Patient Service ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### List all patients
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/patients

### Create a patient (also fires billing provisioning + Kafka event)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Gateway Test",
  "email": "gateway@example.com",
  "address": "12 Gateway Boulevard",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-01-01",
  "registeredDate": "2026-08-21"
}

### Get patient by ID (copy an id from the create/list response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/patients/<id>

### Update patient
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/patients/<id>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Gateway Updated",
  "email": "updated@example.com",
  "address": "99 Updated Avenue"
}

### Update date of birth
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/patients/<id>/date-of-birth
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dateOfBirth": "1985-05-05"
}

### Delete patient (soft-delete; later GETs return 404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/patients/<id>

### ── Docs (proxied through the gateway) ──────────────────────────

### Patient service OpenAPI spec via gateway
GET {{baseUrl}}/api-docs/patients

### Analytics service OpenAPI spec via gateway (if routed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api-docs/analytics
